e/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T00:01:00-07:00","id":1076835,"title":"","content":"Two assumptions going in: we're using the Riverlands for Greece, and I'm using the &quot;advanced character&quot; Essence 2 starting rules. They still have plenty of room to grow over the course of their mythic arcs of course.<br /> <br /> <b>Heracles (born Alcides)</b><br /> <br /> <u>Concept</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: Penance-Bound Incarnation of Virility and Prowess</span></span><br /> <u>Caste</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: Dawn</span></span><br /> <u>Anima</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: Lion</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Attributes</u><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Str *****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Dex ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Sta *****</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Cha ****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Man **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">App ***</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Per **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Int **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Wits ***</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Supernal/Caste/Favored Abilities </u><br /> <b>Brawl</b><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: *****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Archery: ****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Athletics: *****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Awareness: **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Melee: *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Presence:*</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Resistance: ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Survival: ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Thrown: *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">War: ***</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Other Abilities</u><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Craft (Earthworks): ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Integrity: *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Lore: *</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Specializations</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: Displays of Prowess, Wrestling, Hunting, Farming</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Merits</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">:</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Mighty Thew (***)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Boundless Endurance (**)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Command (**)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Artifact (***) [Nemean Lion skin armor]</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Artifact (***) [Hydra fang powerbow]</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Fast Reflexes (***)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Retainer (**) [Iolaus]</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>WP</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: 5</span></span><br /> <u>Essence</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: 2</span></span><br /> <u>Limit Trigger:</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> Someone taking what is his (breaks tend to be violent rages)</span></span><br /> <u>Intimacies:</u><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Megera &amp; Children (Guilt - Defining)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">People Should Fight for What is Theirs (Principle - Defining)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Iolaus (Responsibility - Major)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Euryotheus (Contempt - Minor)</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Charms</u><br /> <br /> <b>Brawl</b><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: Fist of Iron Technique, Ferocious Jab, Heaven Thunder Hammer, Vicious Lunge, Unbreakable Grasp, Devil-Strangling Attitude, Dragon Coil Technique, Ten Calamities Technique, Titan-Straightening Method, Crashing Wave Throw</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Archery: Wise Arrow, Sight Without Eyes, Force Without Fire</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Athletics: Increasing Strength Exercise, Tex Ox Meditation</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Craft: Craftsman Needs No Tools</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Resistance: Ox-Body Technique</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Survival: Hardship Surviving Mendicant Spirit</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">War: War God Descendant, Holistic Battle Understanding</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">[So this should be approximately around the time Heracles and completed his first two labors (which his Artifacts are trophies from), establishing himself a great slayer of monsters and breaking into Essence 2. On the quest for the Golden Hind now that he's essence 2 he'll learn Trackless Region Navigation and Unshakeable Bloodhound Technique, as well as continue to build up his Athletics feats-of-strength Charms. By the time he's on Labor Eight (the Mares of Diomedes) he'll meet up with Orpheus in Not-Thrace who will educate him in the Occult enough for Heracles to learn to wrestle gods, and then the two will travel with Jason toward the Dreaming Sea as Heracles seeks the Girdle of Hippolyta. By the time Heracles is holding up the Dome of Heaven, he'll be Essence 5.]</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">[I'm pretty proud of giving him Craft Earthworks and Craftsman Needs No Tool, as together with his Strength Enhancing Athletics Charms it will allow for things like the cleaning of the Aegean Stables]</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T00:05:12-07:00","id":1076836,"title":"","content":"<b>Orpheus</b><br /> <br /> <u>Concept:</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> Lovelorn Musician on Brink of Religious Revelation</span></span><br /> <u>Caste:</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> Zenith</span></span><br /> <u>Anima:</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> Spiral of Songbirds</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Attributes</u><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Str **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Dex ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Sta **</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Char ****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Man ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">App ****</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Per ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Int ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Wits ***</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Supernal/Caste/Favored Abilities</u><br /> <b>Performance:</b><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> *****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Awareness: *<br /> Brawl: *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Dodge: ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Integrity: ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Linguistics: *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Lore: ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Martial Arts (Silver Voiced Nightingale Style): ****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Occult: ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Presence: *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Survival: ***</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Other Abilities</u><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Athletics **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Socialize *</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Specializations</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: Lyre, Elementals, Singing, Animal-Ken, Legends of the Riverlands</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Merits</u><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Old Realm *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Forest-Tongue *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">High Realm *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Martial Arts ****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Ally *** (Calais)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Cult **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Contacts * (via Cult)</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Willpower: </u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">******</span></span><br /> <u>Essence:</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> **</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Limit Trigger:</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> Witnessing a Pointless Death (breaks tend to be a musically morose existential crisis)</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Intimacies</u><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Eurydice (Love, Dedication - Defining)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Music is Truth (Principle - Major, demoted from Defining by Eurydice's death)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Loss of Self (Terror - Major)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Calais (Desire/Affection - Minor)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Lookshy (Resentment - Minor; I've got some backstory about how his region of the Riverlands [Not-Thrace] is dominated by a Lookshy military encampment)</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Charms</u><br /> <b>Performance:</b><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> Masterful Performance Exercise, Soul-Firing Performance, Respect Commanding Attitude, Phantom-Conjuring Performance, Perfect Harmony Technique, Mood-Inducing Music, Plecteral Harbinger's Approach, Heart Compelling Method, Soul-Stirring Cantata, Seventeen Cycles Symphony (x2)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Dodge: Reed in the Wind</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Integrity: Enduring Mental Toughness, Destiny Manifesting Method</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Lore: Wyld Dispelling Prana</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Martial Arts: Voice of the Nightingale, Inspiring Battle Hymn, Terrifying Battle Shriek, Silver-Voiced Nightingale Form</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Occult: Terrestrial Circle Sorcery (Summon Elemental), Spirit Detecting Glance</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Survival: Food-Gathering Exercise, Friendship with Animals Approach</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">[I literally paid for Seventeen Cycles Symphony to exist specifically for Orpheus </span></span><img src=\"https://forum.rpg.net/images/smilies/smile.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> One trick I'm proud of here was making him a Sorcerer with a musical Shaping Ritual and &quot;Summon Elemental&quot;, as it allows for him to bring forth dancing trees and such with his playing as in legend. Food Gathering Exercise and Friendship with Animals Approach are similarly played out through music bringing nature's friendship to him.]</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-gla