span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Integrity: *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Investigation: ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Lore: ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Martial Arts (Snake Style): ****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Occult: *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Presence: *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Resistance: ***</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Other Abilities</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">:</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Melee: *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Socialize: *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Survival ***</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Specializations:</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> Poisons, Organ Function, Snakes, Mysteries of Death</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Merits</u><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Martial Artist ****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Eidetic Memory **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Retainers *** (his wife and daughters)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Toxin Resistance **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Old Realm *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">High Realm *</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Willpower</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: *****</span></span><br /> <u>Essence</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: **</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Limit Trigger:</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> Being proven fallible</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Intimacies</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> Death is a Treatable Condition [Principle-Defining], Saturn and the purview of Endings [Hate - Major], Snakes [Fascination - Minor], Epione [gratitude - Minor], Daughters [affection - Minor]</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Charms</u><br /> <b>Medicine:</b><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> Ailment-Rectifying Method, Plague-Banishing Incitation, Wound Mending Care, Wound-Cleansing Meditation, Flawless Diagnosis Technique, Contagion Curing Touch, Instant Treatment Method, Wound-Banishing Strike, Anointment of Miraculous Health, Body-Sculpting Essence Method, Wholeness Restoring Meditation</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Awareness: Sensory Acuity Prana, Keen Taste &amp; Smell Technique, Ken Hearing &amp; Touch Technique, Foe Scenting Method, Eyeless Harbinger Awareness</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Investigation: Watchman's Infallible Eye</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Lore: Harmonious Academic Method, Wyld Dispelling Prana, Chaos-Repelling Pattern</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Martial Arts: Serpentine Evasion, Striking Cobra Technique, Snake Form</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">[I leaned into the snake symbolism to flesh out the greatest of Greek Mythic Doctors. Personality wise, I think he came out a lot like Greg House - not much of a bedside matter... Obviously he and Orpheus are natural allies in their quest against Death that will likely lead one or both of them to exploring Necromancy]</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-12-2017, 03:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T00:11:34-07:00","id":1076838,"title":"","content":"[space reserved for Autolycus]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T00:12:27-07:00","id":1076839,"title":"","content":"<b>Jason</b><br /> <br /> <u>Concept</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: Swashbuckling Captain Off to Reclaim His Crown</span></span><br /> <u>Caste</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: Eclipse</span></span><br /> <u>Anima</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: Feminine eyes of his past self, same as those painted on his ship</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Attributes</u><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Str ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Dex ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Sta ***</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Cha ****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Man ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">App ****</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Per ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Int **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Wit **</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Supernal/Caste/Favored Abilities</u><br /> <b>Sail</b><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> *****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Athletics ****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Awareness ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Bureaucracy **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Melee ****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Presence *****</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Ride *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Socialize **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Thrown ***</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">War **</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Other Abilities</u><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Craft (Carpentry) **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Dodge *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Lore *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Resistance ***</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Specializations</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: Shipwright, Seduction, Inspire Teamwork, Sports</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Merits</u><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Artifact *** (Direlance)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Backing ** (Guild)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Direction Sense *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Followers **</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Resources *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">High Realm *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Guild Cant *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Firetongue *</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Forest-tongue *</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Willpower</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: *****</span></span><br /> <u>Essence</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">: **</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Limit Trigger:</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> Achieving a pursued goal (when the hunt/quest/etc is over, he gets bored - when he gets bored, he gets stupid)</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Intimacies:</u><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> Kingdom of his Past Life [Not-Thessaly] (righteous desire - Defining), Argo (Pride - Major), Crew (Loyalty - Major), Dragon-Blooded Social Order (Betrayal - Major), Venus (gratitude - Minor)</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Charms</u><br /> <b>Sail:</b><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> Salty Dog Method, Safe Bearing Technique, Ship Claiming Stance, Weather Anticipating Intuition, Hull-Preserving Technique, Hull-Taming Transfusion, Wind Defying Course Technique, Current Cutting Technique, Tide Carried Omens, Chaos-Cutting Galley, Blood &amp; Salt Bondage</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Melee: Excellent Strike, One Weapon Two Blows, Dipping Swallow Defense, Bulwark Stance, Solar Counterattack</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Presence: Listener-Swaying Argument, Harmonious Presence Method, Excellent Friend Approach</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Resistance: Ox-Body Technique (x3)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">[So Jason's narrative unlike my other 4 Solar Argonauts, is specifically about reclaiming a crown that is his birthright. That's not unique in Greek Myth of course, but it is on this team, so I leaned into that and tied it to the Usurpation narrative rather than him being a literal lost prince. Furthermore, since Hera doesn't have a close equivalent in the Exalted Pantheon, I decided that the divine female figure who he carried on his back and acts as his adviser is his PREVIOUS SELF. He had a vision of her during his Exaltation. Venus is instead his patron goddess he directs his personal worship toward, for reasons that should be obvious in the source legend.]<br /> <br /> [As he already needed to be a sailor for that to be his Supernal Ability in his Exaltation, I decided he had background a tradesman for the Guild before he Exalted (since without the pre-existing identity as a lost prince, he wouldn't be raised in protected isolation by Chiron). This fits better I think for the suave charming seductive swashbuckler he turns out to be than isolated pupil of a centaur]<br /> <br /> [</span></span>If it isn't obvious, I imagine Jason as a smirky asshole who you can't help but like. If you're attracted to men, you'd probably want to sleep with him and be annoyed by that]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-15-2017, 04:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T07:43:08-07:00","id":1076965,"title":"","content":"I wonder if Heracles ought to have a club as well, but otherwise these look pretty good so far. I look forward to seeing your interpretations of Autolycus and Jason.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12738-minty","name":"Minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T09:20:01-07:00","id":1077017,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1076808-solar-argonauts?p=1076965#post1076965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if Heracles ought to have a club as well, but otherwise these look pretty good so far. I look forward to seeing your interpretations of Autolycus and Jason.</div> </div> </div> </div>They'll be the Night caste and Eclipse of this perfect circle, right? An excellent choice of line-up, all together.<br /> <br /> <b>On Hercules </b><span style=\"color:#A9A9A9\">[I'm pretty proud of giving him Craft Earthworks and Craftsman Needs No Tool, as together with his Strength Enhancing Athletics Charms it will allow for things like the cleaning of the Aegean Stables].</span> Brilliant! I was also impressed you gave him archery charms. His bowmanship <i>somehow</i> gets neglected often.<br /> <br /> <b>On Orpheus </b><span style=\"color:#A9A9A9\">[I literally paid for Seventeen Cycles Symphony to exist specifically for Orpheus One trick I'm proud of here was making him a Sorcerer with a musical Shaping Ritual and &quot;Summon Elemental&quot;, as it allows for him to bring forth dancing trees and such with his playing as in legend. Food Gathering Exercise and Friendship with Animals Approach are similarly played out through music bringing nature's friendship to him.]</span> Oh, yes, indeed. Zenith Sorcerer is an <i>excellent </i>fit for a legendary musician, poet, prophet, and worshiper of Apollo. Then too, Silver Voiced Nightingale style allows him to be effective in combat without quite breaking character. <i>Sweetness! </i>Did you also consider the possibility of learning the Thaumaturgical Ritual of Exorcism?<br /> \u200b<br /> <b>On Asclepius </b><span style=\"color:#A9A9A9\">[I leaned into the snake symbolism to flesh out the greatest of Greek Mythic Doctors. Personality wise, I think he came out a lot like Greg House - not much of a bedside matter... Obviously he and Orpheus are natural allies in their quest against Death that will likely lead one or both of them to exploring Necromancy]</span> \u200b Although you didn't make your Twilight a Sorcerer... yet. <i>Huh. </i>Interesting subversion and I do like that. Snake Style is also a splendid choice, not only for the grecian theme, but also for the medical angle of exploiting pressure points and such.<br /> <br /> \u200bOverall some interesting and insightful charm choices that stay true to the mythic source. Very impressive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":487,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","user":"Greyman","date":". 04-12-2017, 01:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T12:15:16-07:00","id":1077115,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1076808-solar-argonauts?p=1076965#post1076965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if Heracles ought to have a club as well, but otherwise these look pretty good so far. I look forward to seeing your interpretations of Autolycus and Jason.</div> </div> </div> </div>Heracles with a club is a straight-up brute. Heracles with a bow is in keeping with a more cultured version.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T12:37:05-07:00","id":1077134,"title":"","content":"He uses clubs when he needs to, but I don't think he &quot;has a club&quot; that would be his personal Artifact club. He just picks up branches etc when he needs one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T13:04:14-07:00","id":1077153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1076808-solar-argonauts?p=1077134#post1077134\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He uses clubs when he needs to, but I don't think he &quot;has a club&quot; that would be his personal Artifact club. He just picks up branches etc when he needs one.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think it needs to be an artifact, either, but the club is pretty iconic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12738-minty","name":"Minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"222"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T13:32:52-07:00","id":1077176,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1076808-solar-argonauts?p=1077153#post1077153\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't think it needs to be an artifact, either, but the club is pretty iconic.</div> </div> </div> </div>In art yeah. Is it references in the legends though? His most iconic slayings I can think of were by bow or barehanded (the sword and torch necessary for the hydra being an outlier, and i decided to lean into Iolaus being invaluable there as a better swordsman than Heracles, as that fits with Heracles being denied credit for the Labor)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-12-2017, 06:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-12T22:04:45-07:00","id":1077523,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Greyman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1076808-solar-argonauts?p=1077017#post1077017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Did you also consider the possibility of learning the Thaumaturgical Ritual of Exorcism?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that will be coming as he continues on his path toward the Underworld and has his religious revelations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T01:18:30-07:00","id":1078805,"title":"","content":"Added Jason<br /> <br /> Still wrestling between two versions of Autolycus, but I'll post him soon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-15-2017, 04:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T15:04:46-07:00","id":1079067,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Greyman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1076808-solar-argonauts?p=1077017#post1077017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They'll be the Night caste and Eclipse of this perfect circle, right? An excellent choice of line-up, all together.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I decided to focus on heroes of the Argonaut generation after I made my initial picks of Orpheus (my favorite) and Heracles (demanded by iconic status). Obviously it would be possible to do some more of other generations.<br /> <br /> I have a few ideas for some other Solar Greek-Heroes. For example, resolving the disputed parentage of Odysseus, while Argo-alumn Laeretes is his father, he inherited the Eclipse Solar Exaltation of Sisyphus.<br /> <br /> If I was going to use some of these characters in game, I'd shake it up a bit (in addition to renaming them somewhat to more Creation appropriate names) and make some of them female. Unfortunately the Greeks being the Greeks are not exactly overflowing with amazing heroines (there are Atalanta and Psyche, but they'd both be Zenith, Supernal Athletics and Integrity respectively, and like I said Orpheus is my favorite so I needed to include him for my Perfect Circle).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T16:56:56-07:00","id":1079117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1076808-solar-argonauts?p=1079067#post1079067\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, I decided to focus on heroes of the Argonaut generation after I made my initial picks of Orpheus (my favorite) and Heracles (demanded by iconic status). Obviously it would be possible to do some more of other generations.<br /> <br /> I have a few ideas for some other Solar Greek-Heroes. For example, resolving the disputed parentage of Odysseus, while Argo-alumn Laeretes is his father, he inherited the Eclipse Solar Exaltation of Sisyphus.<br /> <br /> If I was going to use some of these characters in game, I'd shake it up a bit (in addition to renaming them somewhat to more Creation appropriate names) and make some of them female. Unfortunately the Greeks being the Greeks are not exactly overflowing with amazing heroines (there are Atalanta and Psyche, but they'd both be Zenith, Supernal Athletics and Integrity respectively, and like I said Orpheus is my favorite so I needed to include him for my Perfect Circle).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hippolata and <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Penthesilea</span></span></span>? Medea?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-15T21:00:16-07:00","id":1079211,"title":"","content":"Medea I'm wrestling with because the system doesn't really support potion/elixir/salve based witchcraft on her level. I could give her a bunch of Thaumaturgy rituals, but that doesn't seem like doing her justice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T05:26:00-07:00","id":1079335,"title":"","content":"Vance suggested in the Ask the Devs thread doing it as Workings.<br /> <br /> Really the more problematic aspect is their respective roles in their narratives. Medea murdered Jason's children and her own brother after getting bamboozled into falling in love and then spurned; Hippolyta immediately agrees to give Heracles the prized belt given to her by her father, only to immediately be killed over a deception by Hera (or, in some versions, given to the hero Theseus).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 04-16-2017, 08:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T06:02:30-07:00","id":1079343,"title":"","content":"Well this is Exalted, Medea should punch Jason's whole crew into pigs then fly away to have awesome witchy adventures on........the Southern coast (or the Dreaming Sea ???).<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/6A8QT6h.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T08:12:05-07:00","id":1079368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1076808-solar-argonauts?p=1079335#post1079335\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Vance suggested in the Ask the Devs thread doing it as Workings.<br /> <br /> Really the more problematic aspect is their respective roles in their narratives. Medea murdered Jason's children and her own brother after getting bamboozled into falling in love and then spurned; Hippolyta immediately agrees to give Heracles the prized belt given to her by her father, only to immediately be killed over a deception by Hera (or, in some versions, given to the hero Theseus).</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh they have problematic roles, definetly! The other amazon I suggested basically tried suicide by Achilles. I just meant as inspiration for characters who could then be given an exalted bent/change and were women (as opposed to say Andromeda who does nothing)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T10:05:09-07:00","id":1079419,"title":"","content":"If anyone has thoughts on Jason, I'd love to hear them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T11:10:29-07:00","id":1079438,"title":"","content":"Your take on Jason will both have a hell of a lot of health, <i>and</i> give quite a bit of health to his crew, depending on the ship he gets. Heracles should appreciate the buff.<br /> <br /> \u200b(Misu in my group also took Sail Supernal and Blood and Salt Bondage, but he snagged Sea Devil Training Technique instead. That +2 you get from having a crew with Sail 4 is pretty valuable.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T12:11:18-07:00","id":1079460,"title":"","content":"Yeah Heracles stil has some growing to do in terms of Ox-Body Techniques.<br /> <br /> I invested in Ox-Body techniques and Blood and Salt Bondage because empowering his crew allows Jason to play a stronger role as Captain of the Argo without directly facing all the conflicts himself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T13:27:38-07:00","id":1079487,"title":"","content":"My !Heracles I made for combat testing (Brawl Supernal V Tyrant Lizard) was named Peerless Auroch. More of a phonetic play than any kind of actual meaning based allusion.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure where to even start trying to Exaltify the name &quot;Jason&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T13:35:56-07:00","id":1079491,"title":"","content":"Jai of the Sun, a peerless hero.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-16T17:15:56-07:00","id":1079576,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MoroseMorgan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1076808-solar-argonauts?p=1079487#post1079487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure where to even start trying to Exaltify the name &quot;Jason&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u0399\u03b1\u03c3\u03c9\u03bd (Iason), was derived from Greek \u03b9\u03b1\u03c3\u03b8\u03b1\u03b9 (iasthai), meaning &quot;to heal.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Iasthai&quot; sounds appropriately fantastical, no?<br /> <br /> \u200bAlternatively you could look at some of the elements of his story instead of his exact name. I kinda like the name &quot;Lost Sandal.&quot; <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 04-16-2017, 08:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-25T18:24:38-08:00","id":1292041,"title":"","content":"So I finally realized why I never came up with an Autolycus Night Caste writeup I\u2019m happy with - he isn\u2019t one. He\u2019s a Changing Moon! \u201cThe Wolf Itself\u201d indeed!<br /> <br /> Which means i\u2019ll need to figure out someone else as the Argo\u2019s Night Caste...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-25T19:01:57-08:00","id":1292048,"title":"","content":"I'm honestly shocked you didn't go with Medea as the twilight since she is the most well known. Not going to lie I forgot Asclepius was even a crew member of the Argo.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-26T01:03:26-08:00","id":1292091,"title":"","content":"These are great. I particularly like the limit conditions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-26T04:11:06-08:00","id":1292105,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1076808-solar-argonauts?p=1079335#post1079335\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Really the more problematic aspect is their respective roles in their narratives. Medea murdered Jason's children and her own brother after getting bamboozled into falling in love and then spurned; Hippolyta immediately agrees to give Heracles the prized belt given to her by her father, only to immediately be killed over a deception by Hera (or, in some versions, given to the hero Theseus).</div> </div> </div> </div>They don't really have stories of their own, a trend for that people. Problematic is letting yourself ignore what they can be in this game because you don't like how they were portrayed nearly 3000 years ago.<br /> <br /> Hyppolyta has a plentiful enough status to boast, despite not having her own stories. &quot;Queen of the amazons and daughter of ares&quot; and the feats of the amazons spread over the stories should give you enough to work.<br /> It's as if Achilles only had the one story where he is shot down and dies.<br /> <br /> Medea makes for a pretty fierce godblood sorceress (there's little else in her writings that would give her a bigger splat), and being eclipsed by the exalted is standard fare. Everyone involved ought to regret dismissing her tho.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-26T05:15:44-08:00","id":1292116,"title":"","content":"Do Lunar charms allow for something like witchy elixers and potions and such for Medea?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-26T09:19:59-08:00","id":1292181,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1076808-solar-argonauts?p=1292116#post1292116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do Lunar charms allow for something like witchy elixers and potions and such for Medea?</div> </div> </div> </div>... you know, Medea being Jason\u2019s No Moon Mate might work perfectly, accounting for her sudden love for him she was willing to betray her father for (and the depths she took his betrayal)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-26T09:28:18-08:00","id":1292185,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Synapse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1076808-solar-argonauts?p=1292105#post1292105\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Problematic is letting yourself ignore what they can be in this game because you don't like how they were portrayed nearly 3000 years ago.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair point. We can definitely do better at this point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-26T09:37:47-08:00","id":1292195,"title":"","content":"There's Lunar medicine charms about herbs and so forth.<br /> <br /> But there's also a sorcerous initiation about herbs and potions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-26T09:58:07-08:00","id":1292200,"title":"","content":"Atalanta (Full Moon), Autolycus (Changing Moon), Medea (No Moon), and Periclymenus (Casteless) can join the team once we get the complete Lunar Charm set <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Still need to figure out a Night Caste figure since Autolycus is a Changing Moon. Odysseus would work except he\u2019s not an Argonaut (his dad is and maternal grandad are).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-05T19:14:53-07:00","id":1302984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1076808-solar-argonauts?p=1292200#post1292200\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Atalanta (Full Moon), Autolycus (Changing Moon), Medea (No Moon), and Periclymenus (Casteless) can join the team once we get the complete Lunar Charm set <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Still need to figure out a Night Caste figure since Autolycus is a Changing Moon. Odysseus would work except he\u2019s not an Argonaut (his dad is and maternal grandad are).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I'd go with Atalanta as the Night Caste, going down a different Athletic path than Hercules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/370-oriares","name":"Oriares","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar370_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-05T20:21:31-07:00","id":1302989,"title":"","content":"Its really hard to think up on a sneaky Argonaut, since most of those adventures Jason takes care. I'd agree with Oriares that Atalanta is the only one that comes to mind just for her Supernal but even then it doesnt really fit. Honestly I cant really imagine who would fit. The other popular Argonauts like Peleus, the Boreas, Pollux and Castor, Argus, none of them really screams night unless you want to do some reimagining.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T03:58:31-07:00","id":1303042,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1076808-solar-argonauts?p=1292185#post1292185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fair point. We can definitely do better at this point.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Golden Rule applies to Greek Myth too, Medea killing her own children was probably an invention of Euripides.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1076808-solar-argonauts?p=1292181#post1292181\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... you know, Medea being Jason\u2019s No Moon Mate might work perfectly, accounting for her sudden love for him she was willing to betray her father for (and the depths she took his betrayal)</div> </div> </div> </div> Being the 'barbarian' is also often considered a key part of her (post Euripides) narrative.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-09T06:45:48-07:00","id":1303768,"title":"","content":"If you are still trying to resolve who to represent the night caste in your perfect circle, I would like to nominate Lycneus of Messenia as a candidate. He served as lookout on the Argo and was gifted with superhuman eyesight. That could be readily represented with an awareness supernal night caste. add some lore specialties in geology or a few dots in Craft(gold-smithing) to cover the multiple ways he could &quot;see through the ground&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/738-binary-phantom","name":"Binary Phantom","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar738_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"80"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}